text: |-
  30
  Charlie
  Anyway I am not sure if I will live to see
  the end of this revolution
  I believe you were the piece god meant
  me to meet that will finish the fight
  Since the beginning of tpusa I knew in
  my gut that I might get wiped out at any
  time
  I cannot explain it
  But I dream about it all the time
  Charlie
  Yes you do
  Like all the time
  Anyway thats depressing convo for
  another rite elmao
  time**
  kayneeeeee
  You are going to be the Iron Lady of
  America
  I see it so frekaing clearly
  i might be Moses tho
  I might not see this whole thing through
  Imao
  If that is the case, be my David!
  Dude you don't even realize your power
  yet
  if I tell you the true prophecy I know in
  my gut its really sad
  But I hope its wrong
  That is so weird
  More a fear manifestation than an
  actualización
  Actualization*
  Not really afraid of it but I'm just telling
  you what I know to be true
  @THEINTELSCIF
  IATE CADIY
